cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "VISIONFORGE X: Universal Adaptive Edge Vision Intelligence Platform"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ravichandiran"
    given-names: "Vetrivel"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2024-11-08"
abstract: >-
  VISIONFORGE X is a production-structured software platform built around the
  Digilent ZYBO Z7-10 (Xilinx Zynq-7010 SoC). It fuses FPGA-accelerated image
  processing, ARM-based embedded control, adaptive computer vision, and
  AI-driven visual understanding into a single cohesive desktop application.
  The platform operates in both simulation mode (no hardware required) and
  hardware mode (connected to a real ZYBO board over TCP/UDP).
keywords:
  - computer-vision
  - edge-computing
  - fpga
  - zynq
  - opencv
  - pyside6
  - ai-inference
  - real-time-processing
  - embedded-systems
  - machine-learning
